OL,3,GNEWSAFresh storms strike as flooding
OL,4,Aclear-up continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FFresh storms struck the West Midlands
OL,7,Fon Thursday evening, as the clear up
OL,8,Foperation continued after heavy rain
OL,9,Fpummelled the area previously.
OL,11,FRail lines were blocked at Hall Green
OL,12,Fand Solihull with rain also affecting
OL,13,Fservices near Solihull. Replacement
OL,14,Fbuses were in operation between Shirley
OL,15,Fand Stratford-upon-Avon while damage to
OL,16,Foverhead wires delayed services between
OL,17,FCoventry and Nuneaton.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
