OL,3,GNEWSAFresh storms strike as flooding
OL,4,Aclear-up continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier, Birmingham City Council said
OL,7,F55 properties in the city had
OL,8,Fexperienced internal flooding, with
OL,9,Fwater levels reaching up to one metre
OL,10,Fin the worst-affected homes.
OL,12,FFire crews were called to "significant
OL,13,Fflooding" in Perry Barr around Curbar
OL,14,FRoad, Thornbridge Avenue and Haddon
OL,15,FRoad and told people to avoid the area,
OL,16,Ffollowing a flood warning from the
OL,17,FEnvironment Agency (EA) on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
